---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section class="sd-section sd-notes" id="field-notes">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <SectionHeading
      number="08 / FIELD NOTES"
      title="Architecture decisions"
      emphasis="from runtime to storage."
      description="Practical essays that connect execution and data models with the behavior, limits, and failure modes of production systems."
    />

    <article class="sd-note-feature sd-note-database">
      <div class="sd-note-feature-copy">
        <p class="sd-note-kicker">DATABASES · DATA MODELING · 18 MIN · ES/EN</p>
        <h3>Choose a database from<br /><em>the questions, not the logo.</em></h3>
        <p>
          A practical guide to access patterns, relational and NoSQL models, normalization,
          indexes, sharding, CAP, and polyglot persistence with one source of truth.
        </p>
        <div class="sd-note-links">
          <a href="/en/system-design/choosing-a-database/">Read in English <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>
          <a href="/system-design/elegir-base-de-datos/" lang="es">Leer en español <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sd-note-signal database-signal" aria-hidden="true">
        <p>ACCESS PATTERN</p><b>↓</b>
        <div class="database-models"><span>REL</span><span>DOC</span><span>KV</span><span>GRAPH</span></div>
        <b>↓</b><p>GUARANTEES</p>
        <div class="database-guarantees"><span>CONSISTENCY</span><span>LATENCY</span><span>SCALE</span></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <a class="sd-note-feature" href="/system-design/concurrencia-vs-paralelismo-python/" lang="es">
      <div class="sd-note-feature-copy">
        <p class="sd-note-kicker">PYTHON · CONCURRENCIA · 16 MIN</p>
        <h3>Concurrencia vs. paralelismo:<br /><em>cómo elegir y diseñar el sistema.</em></h3>
        <p>
          Una guía para distinguir espera de cómputo, elegir entre asyncio, threads y procesos,
          y convertir esa decisión en un sistema con límites, backpressure y fallos controlados.
        </p>
        <span class="sd-note-cta">Leer el artículo <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span>
      </div>

      <div class="sd-note-signal" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="signal-labels"><span>CONCURRENCIA</span><span>1 WORKER</span></div>
        <div class="signal-track signal-concurrent">
          <i>A</i><i>B</i><i>A</i><i>C</i><i>B</i><i>C</i>
        </div>
        <div class="signal-labels"><span>PARALELISMO</span><span>3 WORKERS</span></div>
        <div class="signal-track signal-parallel">
          <i>A</i><i>B</i><i>C</i>
        </div>
        <p>esperar mejor <b>≠</b> calcular más rápido</p>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
